Unofficial community plugin, not affiliated with Omarchy or 37signals.

This product includes the wake-core streaming runtime (src/omahey/wake_core.py)
from the Ania Player project by the same author, licensed under Apache-2.0.

Wake word bundles downloaded at runtime use the frozen openWakeWord
front-end models (melspectrogram, embedding; Apache-2.0, David Scripka) and
Silero VAD (MIT, Silero Team). Their licences ship inside each bundle.

omahey does not bundle or redistribute the openWakeWord pre-trained wake
word models (hey_jarvis, alexa, hey_mycroft; CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, David Scripka).
`omahey models download` fetches them from the upstream release only after
the user accepts that licence, and stores the notice next to the model.
